      "snippets": [
        {
          "source_line": 1925,
          "tex": "\\noindent\nThe only goal in this section is to prove the following lemma which\nwill play a key role in algebraization of rig-\\'etale algebras.\nWe will use a bit of the theory of algebraic spaces to prove this lemma;\nan earlier version of this chapter gave a (much longer) proof using algebra\nand a bit of deformation theory that the interested reader can find in\nthe history of the Stacks project."
        }
      ]
